      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "1. Click is captured + which ad\n2. Click data is sent to a high traffic enabled data receiver pool\n3. Click data is sent to a data processor to aggregate clicks capture by different receivers\n4. Aggregated data is de-aggregated and stored\n5. Data is available to be queried by advertisers\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Click is captured + which ad\n2. Click data is sent to a high traffic enabled data receiver pool\n3. Click data is sent to a data processor to aggregate clicks capture by different receivers\n4. Aggregated data is de-aggregated and stored\n5. Data is available to be queried by advertisers\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 139,
      "index": "aU",
      "created": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
